    description: "The lifecycle_hook arm of _detect_from_concepts labels these Android component bases controller; controller has the request-ingress role, so they enter request_ingress, the verify-claims withhold and the taint seed set. Predates the role registry (the registry kept the behaviour). Question to settle: which of these receive outside input (a ContentProvider and an exported BroadcastReceiver do; a Fragment does not), and whether they are hosted-application members like android_activity.\n\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/giron/RESULTS.md. Found while building the entry-kind PR (2026-11-21)."  # d6d1
